[
  {
    "comment": "【认证方式】Cookie 登录态，不需要账号密码。使用登录 www.itsk.com 后的完整 Cookie 与同一浏览器 User-Agent，两项必须成对；推荐在已登录浏览器中用「QianDao Cookie Extractor」一键读取，手动复制时保留 Cookie 原文，不要解码或裁剪。\n\n【本模板做什么】只调用 IT天空固定 Nuxt WebAPI 完成每日签到：\n1. 先生成本次运行唯一的时间戳；\n2. 从同一时间戳派生 X-Request-Nonce 与 X-Request-Signature；\n3. 从 Cookie 中即时读取 itsk_access_token 作为 Authorization；\n4. 调用 sign_activity 并把接口 message 写入日志。不会浏览活动页、发帖或领取其他奖励。\n\n【成功判定】接口必须返回 code=200；当天已签到时站点会幂等返回 200，不会重复领取。4xx/5xx、签名错误、登录失效或安全验证都会失败关闭。\n\n【失效处理】站点返回登录页、明确提示登录失效、验证码或安全验证，以及页面结构不再符合预期时，任务会失败关闭，不会伪造成功。重新登录 www.itsk.com 后成对获取 Cookie 与 User-Agent 即可，模板本身不需要修改。\n\n【补充说明】Cookie 必须包含有效的 itsk_access_token；令牌只在本次运行中从 Cookie 读取，不单独保存。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "api://util/timestamp",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\"状态\"\\s*:\\s*\"200\"",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "itsk_micro_ts",
          "re": "\"16位时间戳\"\\s*:\\s*(\\d+)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "调用 IT天空 Nuxt WebAPI 完成每日签到。接口对当天已签到的账号会幂等返回 200，不会重复领取奖励。",
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://api.itsk.com/webapi/sign_activity",
      "headers": [
        {
          "name": "Cookie",
          "value": "{{cookie}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "User-Agent",
          "value": "{{user_agent}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Origin",
          "value": "https://www.itsk.com"
        },
        {
          "name": "Authorization",
          "value": "{{cookie|regex_search('(?<=itsk_access_token=)[^;]+')}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "X-Request-Timestamp",
          "value": "{{itsk_micro_ts[0:10]}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "X-Request-Nonce",
          "value": "{{to_uuid(itsk_micro_ts)|replace('-', '')}}"
        },
        {
          "name": "X-Request-Signature",
          "value": "{% set nonce = to_uuid(itsk_micro_ts)|replace('-', '') %}{{ (nonce[0:4] ~ itsk_micro_ts[0:10] ~ nonce[28:32] ~ nonce)|sha1 }}"
        },
        {
          "name": "Accept",
          "value": "application/json, text/plain, */*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Referer",
          "value": "https://www.itsk.com/activity/sign"
        }
      ],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\"code\"\\s*:\\s*200",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "^(4|5)\\d\\d$",
          "from": "status"
        },
        {
          "re": "未登录|请登录|请先登录|登录已过期|登录失效|签名失败|签名错误|nonce|timestamp|验证码|人机验证|滑块验证|安全验证|challenge|WZWS|Cloudflare",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "log_value",
          "re": "\"message\"\\s*:\\s*\"([^\"]+)",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "comment": "输出签到结果",
    "request": {
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "api://util/unicode",
      "headers": [],
      "cookies": [],
      "data": "content=IT天空签到完成：{{log_value|default('已完成')|urlencode}}",
      "mimeType": ""
    },
    "rule": {
      "success_asserts": [
        {
          "re": "\"状态\"\\s*:\\s*\"200\"",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ],
      "failed_asserts": [],
      "extract_variables": [
        {
          "name": "__log__",
          "re": "\"转换后\"\\s*:\\s*\"(.*)\"",
          "from": "content"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
